{"id":"Wc380ba542950a352e7e85485","zh":"保养域","en":"","name":"保养域","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"Wc380ba542950a352e7e85485","text":"保养域","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Saea7ba9b8e84f5ea1982","source_id":"P107","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"为满足识别精度,本文将车辆系统部件的振动加速度指标划分为9个等级,每3个等级组成1个动力响应指标域,分别为整修域、恶化域及保养域,以累积概率70%、30%为临界点,域等级由低级到高级。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S447e44e2b10ca5e382fd","source_id":"P107","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"若Pt为阈值,当Pr>Pt时,此网格内的控制指标全部处在低等级域(如整修域),标记为“+1”;当Pr≤Pt时,此网格内的散点全部为低等级域对应的其余联合域(如恶化-保养域),标记为“-1”。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P107":{"id":"P107","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明","year":"2016","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2016.05.013","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"对应较小动力响应的一组等级。","language":"zh","source_id":"P107","paper_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wfd52c5ffce5ba4c336e416f0","name":"Maintaining region","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"Wfd52c5ffce5ba4c336e416f0","name":"Maintaining region","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equivalents":[{"id":"Wfd52c5ffce5ba4c336e416f0","na